{%- comment -%}
  Handler — test_echo (TEST FIXTURE). Read-only. Returns the validated message so the
  coverage suite can confirm the value survived validation unchanged (no coercion).
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign result = '{}' | parse_json
  hash_assign result['echo'] = arguments.message
